/*N*/Nicolas' notes on the intruder
/*C*/
/*S*/
/*TF*/Tonight, a man dressed in strange white clothing was skulking around my house. He held a tubular instrument that cast long rays of bright light. It was unlike anything I have ever seen. The stranger started muttering to himself. He said something about an Object... Alpha 186. He also mumbled something about checking up on other facilities. I have no idea what he was raving about...
 He made his way to the back of the house, so I followed him. I wanted to corner the trespasser in the backyard, but in spite of pursuing him so closely, I found no living soul there. The only trace I found was a strange, square plaque laying on my desk with someone's name written on it. I can't make sense of any of this, for this encounter has left my mind muddled.
If I had to guess, I'd say the intruder fled through the other exit—through that odd door. I must make sure he does not leave this place alive. If I am missing when you read this, it means that the intruder must have killed or captured me. Beware!
